chapter AFP

session MFODL_Monitor_Imp = MFODL_Monitor_Dense +
  description
    "Imperative refinement of the Since structure and of the monitor's evaluation function, and
     the heap-resident dense monitor of Dense_Imp (not proved to simulate the kernel, and not the
     one the binary ships: that is the export of MFODL_Monitor_Dense.Monitor_Code_Dense).
     Separate session so that the base session, whose heap image it reuses, does not have to be
     rebuilt when the refinement changes."
  theories
    Table_Imp
    Imap_Correct
    Optimized_Since_Imp
    Since_Imp2
    Join_Imp2
    Until_Imp2
    Monitor_Imp2
    Dense_Imp
    Dense_Join_Correct
    Dense_Imp_Code_Opt
    Monitor_Imp
  theories [document=false]
    Monitor_Code_Imp
  export_files (in ".") [2]
    "MFODL_Monitor_Imp.Monitor_Code_Imp:code/**"
